## Per-dataset regenerable/heavy state -- never committed, rebuilt from input/
## by build_stage1()/run_stage_A()/run_stage_B() (see R/00_config.R's receipt
## machinery for what "regenerable" means here).
**/cache/
**/output/
summary.csv
alignment_summary.csv

## Real GT panels are large and, per this project's established convention
## (LDscnR-paper/module_3sp/data/README.md), raw data is not committed --
## only a provenance record. examples/ is the one exception: its inputs are
## small per-chromosome subsets checked in on purpose so the pipeline can be
## verified end-to-end without external data. Do not add a blanket input/
## ignore rule that would also hide those.

## Full-genome dataset folders for timing/size_floor-at-realistic-scale runs
## (see full_runs/build_full.R) -- large (multi-hundred-MB GT matrices),
## never committed.
full_runs/

.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.DS_Store

## LaTeX build artifacts for doc/manual.tex -- only the .tex source and the
## built .pdf are committed, not pdflatex's own intermediate files.
doc/*.aux
doc/*.log
doc/*.out
doc/*.toc
